e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"治疗期内不进行剂量调整；漏服当日不补服","quote_sha256":"751fee3de79b8ac29cf1b326f63107a4795eca966525605c700b888017d1dc7f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es12"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"V6（第16周）：电话随访安全性","quote_sha256":"e93f21a534b5dc580e9f55829c3593bd1a0ee3e2441f17a3477ec7c3559f37ec","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es10"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_5922bd5fc9a7960d:full-draft:169541ab3ec4ac765e3fea9b","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_2e53249f895b76ce\n章节编号=7.1.4\n章节标题=研究治疗终止、退出研究及失访处理\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"3839ac7503d8424f49ef6cfba76456bbeab067366737970e616970dd82f4b974","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:169541ab3ec4ac765e3fea9b","span_id":"es13"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es11","es12","es10","es13"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充项目实施方案中关于治疗终止触发条件（如安全性事件、依从性不足、受试者主动退出等）及终止后数据采集范围的规定","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_714_01","missing_source_classes":["研究治疗终止操作规则"],"target":"研究治疗终止的触发条件与操作程序"},{"action":"补充失访定义（如连续未联系次数或时间窗）、失访后数据收集方式及统计分析中缺失数据处理策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_714_02","missing_source_classes":["失访处理流程"],"target":"失访判定标准及处理流程"}],"heading":"研究治疗终止、退出研究及失访处理","missing_source_classes":["研究治疗终止操作规则","退出研究及失访处理流程"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用治疗策略视角（treatment policy）进行分析：无论受试者是否终止试验药物或发生伴发事件，均按随机分组评估第12周血浆NT-proBNP较基线的相对变化；敏感性分析采用填补策略处理死亡后缺失数据。双盲治疗期为第0天至第12周，安全性随访期为末次给药后4周（至第16周）。治疗期内不进行剂量调整；漏服当日不补服。第16周访视（V6）以电话随访方式完成安全性评估。关于研究治疗终止的具体触发条件、受试者主动退出研究的操作流程、失访的判定标准及后续处理措施，本章节需依据项目实施方案进一步确定。","rationale":"治疗策略视角、12周治疗期、4周安全性随访期、不进行剂量调整、漏服不补服、V6电话随访安全性均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。终止触发条件、退出操作流程和失访处理规则在允许来源中未提供，需项目实施方案或操作手册补充。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（伴发事件）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_2e53249f895b76ce","section_number":"7.1.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:169541ab3ec4ac765e3fea9b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001084410_88ca8844","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"主要终点：第12周血浆NT-proBNP较基线的相对变化（对数尺度）；评价时点：基线、第4周、第8周、第12周","quote_sha256":"5949a234d0cd6f3833aa4c15e07d10ca7178fa7d59746f16d35b225f5090de16","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"关键次要终点：第12周6分钟步行距离较基线变化；第12周KCCQ总分较基线变化","quote_sha256":"a4e20e3473c4319351048cd9e61d3292e4bdce543adb364948262aca7e7bf761","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"其他次要终点：第12周LVEF较基线变化；第12周NYHA分级改善比例","quote_sha256":"281a1f88f8bbeba52cecef7c2d08304fca5fa7b52ad13f8cb0e0798a39fd5092","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"探索性终点：第12周可溶性sGC活性标志物与cGMP水平变化（探索性药效学）","quote_sha256":"e0236dee7b4a57c7a943b8b4172710c5503214c51f3d7857e12cf323002e4eb1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es2","es3","es4","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[],"heading":"有效性评估","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的主要有效性终点为第12周血浆NT-proBNP较基线的相对变化（对数尺度），评价时点包括基线、第4周、第8周和第12周。关键次要有效性终点为第12周6分钟步行距离（6MWD）较基线变化和第12周堪萨斯城心肌病问卷（KCCQ）总分较基线变化。其他次要有效性终点为第12周左室射血分数（LVEF）较基线变化和第12周纽约心脏协会（NYHA）心功能分级改善比例。探索性有效性终点为第12周可溶性sGC活性标志物与环磷酸鸟苷（cGMP）水平变化，用于探索性药效学评估。主要有效性分析采用协方差分析（ANCOVA），以基线log-NT-proBNP为协变量，固定效应包含剂量组与分层因素；剂量-效应关系采用Emax模型进行探索性拟合；次要终点采用层级序贯检验。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），以符合方案集（PPS）进行敏感性分析。","rationale":"主要终点、关键次要终点、其他次要终点、探索性终点、评价时点及统计分析策略均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。需医学经理确认：（1）V3（第4周）是否采集6MWT而V4（第8周）不采集6MWT；（2）KCCQ是否在V4和V5均采集而V3不采集；（3）探索性终点可溶性sGC活性标志物与cGMP的采集时点是否仅限第12周。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_954b96418f81ed94","section_number":"7.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:169541ab3ec4ac765e3fea9b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001084410_88ca8844","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"安全性终点：不良事件与严重不良事件发生率；症状性低血压与晕厥事件发生率；生命体征、心电图、实验室检查异常","quote_sha256":"c6fc4c27066aa8f1663d6f618a33d9d98cc1524aaa2f28dc6a40d63b33d233e8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es6"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：症状性低血压：收缩压<90mmHg伴头晕、黑矇或晕厥；严重低血钾：血钾<3.0mmol/L","quote_sha256":"3e90e3d7f3b69faa90c96c165f644f0d0d6eb3224e95fdfad5afd239f72fa84a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es7"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（第-2周至第0天）：合格性确定；双盲治疗期（第0天至第12周）：随机分组治疗；安全性随访期（末次给药后4周）：不良事件随访","quote_sha256":"ce5b041987eb6b962d955e72fee27b897997311fb0155b5f3ae2e9895382ce6f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es11"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"V1筛选（-2周）：病史、体检、实验室、NT-proBNP、心电图、超声心动图","quote_sha256":"c28bfd32d2163fe4d51385fdd367c5002caf532d986fcbb818dd2445cbb98c13","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es8"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"V6（第16周）：电话随访安全性","quote_sha256":"e93f21a534b5dc580e9f55829c3593bd1a0ee3e2441f17a3477ec7c3559f37ec","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es10"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"V3（第4周）：安全性、NT-proBNP、6MWT\nV4（第8周）：安全性、KCCQ\nV5（第12周）：主要终点全套评估","quote_sha256":"ce798f75a901ee2327ac9acc09a7630a630f5ae2274f17887e13c4b49e7e074d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es9"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es6","es7","es11","es8","es10","es9"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充项目安全性管理方案中关于不良事件分类定义、TEAE采集窗口、SAE/SUSAR报告时限及报告对象的规定","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_73_01","missing_source_classes":["AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与采集报告规则"],"target":"AE/SAE/SUSAR定义、采集窗口、报告对象与时限"},{"action":"补充症状性低血压和严重低血钾的监测频率、确认流程、干预措施及报告要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_73_02","missing_source_classes":["AESI监测与处理流程"],"target":"AESI监测与处理流程"},{"action":"补充生命体征、心电图、实验室检查在各访视中的具体测量参数、操作标准及异常处理流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_73_03","missing_source_classes":["安全性评估操作规范"],"target":"安全性评估中各项检查的具体操作规范"}],"heading":"安全性评估","missing_source_classes":["AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与采集报告规则","AESI监测与处理流程","安全性评估操作规范"],"proposal_text":"本研究的安全性评估涵盖以下方面：不良事件（AE）与严重不良事件（SAE）发生率；症状性低血压与晕厥事件发生率；生命体征、心电图及实验室检查异常。特别关注的不良事件（AESI）包括：症状性低血压，定义为收缩压低于90mmHg伴头晕、黑矇或晕厥；严重低血钾，定义为血钾低于3.0mmol/L。安全性评估贯穿双盲治疗期（第0天至第12周）及安全性随访期（末次给药后4周，至第16周）。V1筛选访视包含病史采集、体格检查、实验室检查、NT-proBNP、心电图和超声心动图；V3（第4周）、V4（第8周）和V5（第12周）访视均包含安全性评估；V6（第16周）以电话随访方式完成安全性评估。安全性数据采用描述性统计进行分析。关于不良事件和严重不良事件的定义、采集窗口、报告对象与时限、特别关注不良事件的监测与处理流程，以及安全性评估中各项检查的具体操作规范，本章节需依据项目安全性管理方案进一步确定。","rationale":"安全性终点类别、AESI定义（症状性低血压和严重低血钾）、研究时期划分、各访视安全性评估安排及描述性统计方法均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与采集报告规则、AESI监测处理流程、安全性评估具体操作规范在允许来源中未提供，需项目安全性管理方案或操作手册补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_ff9812d8969265dd","section_number":"7.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:169541ab3ec4ac765e3fea9b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001084410_88ca8844","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充项目安全性管理方案或操作手册中关于生命体征测量参数、测量时点、操作规范及异常处理的规定","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_731_01","missing_source_classes":["生命体征测量参数与操作规范"],"target":"生命体征具体测量参数（血压、心率、体温、呼吸频率等）及测量频率"},{"action":"补充体格检查的具体项目清单、各访视是否均实施、异常判定标准及处理流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_731_02","missing_source_classes":["体格检查项目与频率"],"target":"体格检查项目、频率及异常处理"}],"heading":"生命体征和体格检查","missing_source_classes":["生命体征测量参数与操作规范","体格检查项目与频率","安全性评估操作手册"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前允许来源中，V1筛选访视列出'体检'，V3至V5访视列出'安全性'评估，但未明确列出生命体征的具体测量参数（如血压、心率、体温、呼吸频率）、测量频率、操作规范、异常判定标准及处理流程。'安全性'一词不能直接等同于完整的生命体征和体格检查方案。本章节需要项目安全性管理方案或操作手册提供具体测量参数、频率、操作规范及异常处理规则后方可形成实质正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_5dba08dfeb1bb301","section_number":"7.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:169541ab3ec4ac765e3fea9b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"e327de83dee73452e07caf2222e78b04be9a012